WEBVTT

01:30.950 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.039 --> 01:37.860
[Episode 24]

01:40.350 --> 01:41.430
You all, sit down!

01:51.590 --> 01:52.509
I know

01:53.590 --> 01:54.990
that wearing this outfit

01:56.289 --> 01:58.090
dishonors our fallen brothers.

01:59.240 --> 02:00.440
But if I don't wear it,

02:02.680 --> 02:06.140
I'd be betraying the friends
who risked their lives to save me.

02:08.590 --> 02:10.190
Neither could I save you all!

02:12.440 --> 02:14.290
I know none of you fear death.

02:16.170 --> 02:17.770
Back on the day the city fell,

02:19.350 --> 02:20.190
we had already

02:20.190 --> 02:21.520
given up our lives.

02:24.400 --> 02:25.960
But today is different—

02:28.390 --> 02:30.120
the battle is over.

02:31.900 --> 02:34.160
The battles of our entire lives are over!

02:37.190 --> 02:38.000
From now on,

02:40.280 --> 02:42.880
none of you are allowed to
touch weapons again.

02:44.890 --> 02:46.360
Wash yourselves clean,

02:49.510 --> 02:51.000
shave your heads,

02:52.940 --> 02:54.310
and go home.

02:56.329 --> 02:58.750
Those who were craftsmen,
return to your craft.

02:58.750 --> 03:01.150
Those who were farmers,
go back to farming.

03:01.590 --> 03:03.250
The land has been left fallow.

03:04.570 --> 03:06.500
You'll need to plow it thoroughly.

03:07.630 --> 03:09.000
Sow the seeds,

03:10.240 --> 03:11.640
and live to see next year.

03:15.520 --> 03:16.800
You must believe—

03:18.030 --> 03:21.680
believe that there is justice
in this world.

03:25.250 --> 03:26.850
If you don't believe it,

03:29.150 --> 03:31.140
then treat it this way.

03:37.120 --> 03:38.400
-General!
-General!

05:48.420 --> 05:49.590
Thank you for your hard work, Marshal Jiu.

05:49.590 --> 05:51.250
I'll go handle the aftermath.

05:51.590 --> 05:52.190
Hold on.

05:54.270 --> 05:55.470
Thirty li to the west,

05:55.680 --> 05:57.010
there's one of my camps.

05:57.120 --> 05:58.580
The travel permits and money
have been prepared.

05:58.580 --> 06:00.630
They can shave their heads,
change clothes,

06:00.630 --> 06:02.160
take the money, and go home.

06:02.510 --> 06:03.710
No one will stop them.

06:04.630 --> 06:07.160
Marshal Jiu, thank you for
keeping your word.

06:08.600 --> 06:09.660
Li Cheng... I mean,

06:11.840 --> 06:14.010
General Li. I still need his head.

06:14.730 --> 06:16.990
After all, I was the one
who took him away.

06:17.190 --> 06:18.920
If the higher-ups ask about it,

06:20.100 --> 06:21.630
I won't be able to handle it.

06:22.240 --> 06:23.040
Of course.

06:24.070 --> 06:25.430
General Li's head

06:26.290 --> 06:27.950
is worth a red official's hat.

06:38.600 --> 06:39.750
By order of Marshal Jiu:

06:39.750 --> 06:41.560
the main force is to move 30 li west.

06:41.560 --> 06:42.870
Shave your heads, wash your faces,

06:42.870 --> 06:44.159
collect your travel permits
and expenses,

06:44.159 --> 06:44.890
and then return to
your respective hometowns.

06:44.890 --> 06:45.270
Yes.

06:45.290 --> 06:47.350
I've already made all preparations.

06:57.630 --> 06:58.480
Ms. Bai.

06:59.190 --> 07:01.600
If you feel sad, it's okay to cry.

07:04.280 --> 07:05.360
I won't cry.

07:06.950 --> 07:08.310
I always knew

07:09.780 --> 07:11.090
this day would come.

07:19.700 --> 07:21.130
He got what he wanted.

07:22.490 --> 07:23.970
I'm happy for him.

07:35.180 --> 07:36.300
He gave up his life

07:36.880 --> 07:38.940
so that everyone else could survive.

07:40.880 --> 07:42.320
Such compassion

07:43.900 --> 07:46.960
is something you should tell
your child about someday.

07:53.760 --> 07:54.340
Someone!

07:54.690 --> 07:55.490
Take him away!

08:15.480 --> 08:16.540
What are you doing?

08:16.830 --> 08:18.230
Where are you taking him?

08:19.320 --> 08:20.720
Where are you taking him?

08:20.790 --> 08:21.930
They will give him a proper burial!

08:21.930 --> 08:23.000
No, they won't!

08:23.930 --> 08:24.930
They won't!

08:25.990 --> 08:26.800
Put him down!

08:26.800 --> 08:28.120
-Where are you taking him?
-Gu Pingyuan!

08:28.120 --> 08:30.060
All they want is his head!

08:30.270 --> 08:31.730
Those despicable people!

08:37.159 --> 08:38.610
Where are you taking him?

08:39.669 --> 08:40.210
You...

08:40.240 --> 08:41.630
Where are you taking him?

08:41.630 --> 08:42.390
Let go!

08:56.150 --> 08:57.810
Ms. Bai still hasn't woken up,

08:58.660 --> 09:00.790
and Pingyuan won't do any work either.

09:01.320 --> 09:03.080
The whole household
is relying on me alone right now,

09:03.080 --> 09:04.480
using me like an ox.

09:05.720 --> 09:07.030
If my legs were in good shape,

09:07.030 --> 09:08.730
I'd be the one taking care of things.

09:08.730 --> 09:09.880
Nagging so much.

09:10.080 --> 09:12.240
You see, when others become officials,

09:12.240 --> 09:13.320
it's all fancy sedan chairs

09:13.320 --> 09:14.630
and mountains of gold and silver.

09:14.630 --> 09:16.030
But what about Pingyuan?

09:16.030 --> 09:16.720
Becoming an official

09:16.720 --> 09:17.960
almost killed him.

09:19.350 --> 09:21.390
He just doesn't have a brain like mine.

09:21.390 --> 09:22.910
If I, Gu Pingwen, were to be an official,

09:22.910 --> 09:23.670
not to mention anything else—

09:23.670 --> 09:25.730
I'd first get myself two concubines.

09:26.970 --> 09:28.410
Go dream on.

09:32.700 --> 09:33.370
Mother,

09:34.200 --> 09:36.060
can I discuss something with you?

09:36.710 --> 09:37.520
You know,

09:37.550 --> 09:38.480
I'm a grown man,

09:38.630 --> 09:39.670
and taking care of a female guest
every day—

09:39.670 --> 09:40.910
it's also inconvenient for her.

09:40.910 --> 09:41.720
If you ask me,

09:42.550 --> 09:44.550
we should invite Miss Liao
to come help out.

09:44.550 --> 09:46.350
It would be better for everyone.

09:52.480 --> 09:53.270
Doctor,

09:53.630 --> 09:54.670
thank you for your hard work.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.200
Please,

09:55.320 --> 09:56.580
come and have some tea.

10:01.480 --> 10:02.200
Doctor,

10:02.790 --> 10:03.990
how's her condition?

10:05.440 --> 10:06.750
Her lungs and internal organs

10:06.750 --> 10:08.330
are cold above and inflamed below.

10:08.330 --> 10:10.260
The inflammation won't break out.

10:10.670 --> 10:12.400
Ms. Bai just refuses to wake up.

10:13.880 --> 10:15.640
She's heartbroken.

10:16.070 --> 10:17.310
You're just a kid.

10:17.480 --> 10:18.940
You wouldn't understand.

10:19.270 --> 10:20.330
Go check on Ms. Bai.

10:23.120 --> 10:23.720
Doctor,

10:25.320 --> 10:26.670
is there any good solution?

10:26.670 --> 10:27.730
Her pulse

10:27.910 --> 10:29.910
is even weaker than
an 80-year-old man's.

10:29.910 --> 10:31.370
When someone wants to die,

10:31.910 --> 10:33.720
even legendary physicians
like Bian Que and Hua Tuo

10:33.720 --> 10:34.720
would be at a loss.

10:47.920 --> 10:48.520
Ms. Bai.

10:53.220 --> 10:54.500
It's okay. It's okay.

10:56.960 --> 10:57.690
Ms. Bai.

10:57.830 --> 10:58.630
It's okay now.

10:59.910 --> 11:00.510
It's okay.

11:42.670 --> 11:43.240
Father.

11:47.030 --> 11:47.550
Father,

11:48.390 --> 11:50.030
I finally get to see you.

11:50.480 --> 11:51.030
Father.

11:53.960 --> 11:54.910
Silly kid.

11:55.550 --> 11:56.630
Why are you crying?

11:57.230 --> 11:59.000
Did you have a nightmare?

12:01.200 --> 12:01.750
Yes.

12:03.480 --> 12:04.600
Where am I?

12:07.240 --> 12:08.570
Don't you recognize it?

12:09.550 --> 12:10.600
All over this mountain

12:10.600 --> 12:12.400
is our family's tea plantation.

12:12.550 --> 12:14.240
I often drink tea here.

12:14.480 --> 12:15.460
You'd promise

12:15.550 --> 12:17.000
to play Go with me,

12:17.360 --> 12:18.320
but before we could set up the pieces,

12:18.320 --> 12:19.720
you'd fall asleep.

12:22.870 --> 12:24.320
Did I sleep for long?

12:24.840 --> 12:26.750
About the time it takes
for an incense stick to burn.

12:26.750 --> 12:27.550
What's wrong?

12:28.200 --> 12:29.600
What did you dream about?

12:34.370 --> 12:35.490
I dreamed that

12:35.670 --> 12:37.440
suddenly there was chaos and war.

12:37.440 --> 12:38.120
Yimei!

12:38.780 --> 12:39.670
I was captured

12:39.720 --> 12:41.720
and taken to the enemy's military camp.

12:41.720 --> 12:43.600
I dreamed that Gu came back

12:43.840 --> 12:45.440
and rescued me from the camp.

12:48.670 --> 12:49.600
I dreamed...

12:50.480 --> 12:51.720
It really is you.

12:52.630 --> 12:53.940
I prayed to it every day...

12:53.940 --> 12:54.790
I dreamed...

12:54.910 --> 12:56.910
Just to let me see you again.

12:56.960 --> 12:58.150
For that, I'd even accept the fate

12:58.150 --> 13:00.480
of being torn into pieces with no regrets.

13:01.390 --> 13:04.840
I fell in love with a general.

13:07.360 --> 13:08.090
All of you...

13:08.390 --> 13:10.360
All of you were mad at me.

13:12.550 --> 13:13.840
Later, he died.

13:15.390 --> 13:17.240
Everyone died.

13:19.150 --> 13:21.010
And I was pregnant with his child.

13:23.550 --> 13:24.140
Father.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.310
All of that was just a dream,

13:26.310 --> 13:26.910
right?

13:28.590 --> 13:29.750
I've never had

13:29.750 --> 13:31.000
such a long dream before.

13:31.000 --> 13:32.160
I was terrified.

13:32.840 --> 13:33.630
Now I feel

13:33.670 --> 13:34.930
as if I've been reborn.

13:35.510 --> 13:35.970
Father.

13:38.280 --> 13:39.030
I won't make you angry

13:39.030 --> 13:40.270
ever again.

13:42.220 --> 13:43.440
Good girl.

14:05.320 --> 14:06.720
Let me ask you something:

14:08.110 --> 14:09.970
if that general were to come back,

14:10.600 --> 14:12.930
you would still go with him, wouldn't you?

14:17.150 --> 14:18.270
Even though it was a dream,

14:18.270 --> 14:19.790
your feelings were real.

14:22.000 --> 14:22.670
Kid.

14:24.240 --> 14:25.720
I won't be angry with you.

14:26.910 --> 14:28.240
No matter what you do,

14:29.480 --> 14:31.540
as long as you live this life in peace,

14:32.550 --> 14:34.200
my wish will be fulfilled.

16:07.510 --> 16:08.240
Who is it?

16:10.360 --> 16:11.290
Coming. Coming.

16:17.150 --> 16:17.750
Mr. Hou Er.

16:18.440 --> 16:19.340
Old Master Hu.

16:20.240 --> 16:21.840
My brother isn't feeling well.

16:21.840 --> 16:22.870
He can't receive visitors.

16:22.870 --> 16:24.280
We came here

16:24.360 --> 16:25.690
specially to see Mr. Gu.

16:26.290 --> 16:27.550
Since that's the case,

16:27.620 --> 16:28.670
I won't go in.

16:29.080 --> 16:29.600
Hou Er.

16:29.910 --> 16:30.630
The gifts.

16:30.720 --> 16:31.520
Old Master Hu.

16:31.970 --> 16:32.690
[Fortune and Peace]

16:33.150 --> 16:33.790
Mr. Gu.

16:33.910 --> 16:34.360
You...

16:34.990 --> 16:36.330
Why are you up?

16:37.980 --> 16:39.390
Weren't you feeling unwell?

16:39.390 --> 16:39.990
This is...

16:40.260 --> 16:40.790
Old Master Hu,

16:40.790 --> 16:41.940
sorry for neglecting you.

16:41.940 --> 16:43.080
Come on, let's talk inside.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.140
Alright, alright.

16:45.080 --> 16:45.880
Old Master Hu,

16:46.600 --> 16:47.630
whatever you have to say,

16:47.630 --> 16:49.160
please speak frankly.

16:49.790 --> 16:50.720
I heard

16:51.910 --> 16:54.440
you have an old connection

16:55.480 --> 16:57.690
with Li Wantang's family in the capital?

16:57.690 --> 16:59.750
I wouldn't call it an old connection.

16:59.910 --> 17:01.340
I am somewhat acquainted

17:01.480 --> 17:02.610
with his son, Li Qin,

17:03.180 --> 17:04.000
but Li Wantang

17:04.030 --> 17:05.589
is the wealthiest man
north of the Yangtze River.

17:05.589 --> 17:07.160
How could I ever associate with
someone of his status?

17:07.160 --> 17:08.000
I see.

17:10.200 --> 17:12.270
Your "Top Tea Under Heaven"

17:12.880 --> 17:14.329
has really angered him.

17:15.079 --> 17:16.750
He's gathered many tea merchants,

17:16.750 --> 17:18.349
and now they're all united against us.

17:18.349 --> 17:20.680
Not a single tael of Anhui tea

17:20.680 --> 17:22.740
is allowed to be purchased this year.

17:22.880 --> 17:24.960
Li Wantang actually
has that much influence?

17:24.960 --> 17:28.730
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

17:25.480 --> 17:26.960
Well, Mr. Li Million

17:27.440 --> 17:28.830
is prominent and wealthy.

17:28.830 --> 17:29.550
And we

17:29.720 --> 17:32.050
have known each other for quite some time.

17:32.640 --> 17:33.410
How about we

17:33.590 --> 17:35.450
ask Mr. Li to come out and mediate?

17:36.160 --> 17:38.010
After all, Gu Pingyuan's matter

17:38.240 --> 17:39.570
is his personal affair.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.000
Dragging all of us

17:41.000 --> 17:42.640
Anhui tea merchants into it

17:43.000 --> 17:44.830
seems rather inappropriate,
don't you think?

17:44.830 --> 17:46.780
-Yes, exactly.
-That's right.

17:46.810 --> 17:48.110
His personal affair?

17:49.030 --> 17:51.350
This plaque is hanging here
in the Tea Merchants' Association.

17:51.350 --> 17:52.640
How do you explain that?

17:52.640 --> 17:53.240
No, no, no.

17:53.680 --> 17:55.280
It's not what you think it is.

17:55.590 --> 17:57.030
The Empress Dowager

17:56.540 --> 17:59.740
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

17:57.160 --> 17:58.480
bestowed this plaque upon us.

17:58.480 --> 17:59.720
We didn't ask for it.

17:59.880 --> 18:02.000
It's like a pie falling from the sky
and hitting us on the head—

18:02.000 --> 18:03.450
we've got no say in it.

18:03.830 --> 18:04.290
Well...

18:05.030 --> 18:05.880
And now, it's brought resentment

18:05.880 --> 18:07.030
against us Anhui tea merchants.

18:07.030 --> 18:08.270
We feel wronged too.

18:08.400 --> 18:09.240
That's right.

18:09.310 --> 18:10.080
Exactly.

18:10.110 --> 18:10.840
I understand

18:11.110 --> 18:12.200
your reasoning,

18:12.480 --> 18:14.790
but those tea merchants won't accept it.

18:15.110 --> 18:16.790
They lost so much money,

18:17.030 --> 18:19.380
and your Anhui tea got all the glory.

18:19.460 --> 18:23.690
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

18:20.350 --> 18:21.750
In times like these,

18:22.230 --> 18:23.960
with war and chaos everywhere,

18:24.110 --> 18:25.040
wherever you go,

18:25.240 --> 18:26.820
money does all the talking.

18:27.640 --> 18:29.250
My father

18:29.440 --> 18:31.370
doesn't have that much influence.

18:32.640 --> 18:33.970
I've come here this time

18:34.050 --> 18:34.790
to discuss

18:34.790 --> 18:36.110
with all of you.

18:37.550 --> 18:38.350
If, in the future,

18:38.350 --> 18:40.550
you still want to work

18:40.580 --> 18:41.640
with the Li family,

18:41.720 --> 18:43.520
you'll have to give us a discount

18:44.750 --> 18:46.240
on this batch of spring tea.

18:46.240 --> 18:49.040
That Li Wantang has connections
with foreigners.

18:49.640 --> 18:50.480
They've secretly

18:50.480 --> 18:52.640
formed some kind of

18:52.680 --> 18:54.280
offense-defense alliance.

18:54.830 --> 18:56.310
Those foreigners

18:56.440 --> 18:58.540
aren't buying even a single tael of tea
from us this year.

18:58.540 --> 18:59.640
This is really bad.

19:00.070 --> 19:01.400
Hold on, Old Master Hu.

19:01.480 --> 19:03.000
Though my family has grown tea
for generations,

19:03.000 --> 19:03.660
I don't have

19:04.030 --> 19:05.760
much experience in selling it.

19:05.920 --> 19:07.320
I'll need you to teach me.

19:07.590 --> 19:08.160
Well,

19:08.270 --> 19:10.160
in previous years, our Anhui tea

19:10.400 --> 19:11.800
had three destinations.

19:11.880 --> 19:12.510
First,

19:12.830 --> 19:14.960
it went to tea shops across the country.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.350
Second, a portion

19:16.400 --> 19:18.800
was sold to Mongolia, Tibet, and Xinjiang.

19:19.240 --> 19:20.160
And third—

19:20.270 --> 19:21.530
which is the majority—

19:21.590 --> 19:23.120
was shipped to Guangzhou,

19:23.350 --> 19:25.350
where the 13 Trading Houses would handle

19:25.350 --> 19:27.480
consignment sales to the foreigners.

19:27.790 --> 19:30.610
Our entire Anhui Province's tax revenue

19:30.920 --> 19:32.270
and the people's livelihood

19:32.270 --> 19:33.400
depend on this.

19:34.110 --> 19:35.400
Now that we're at war,

19:35.480 --> 19:37.990
the imperial court has allowed us

19:38.070 --> 19:39.480
to ship it to nearby Shanghai.

19:39.480 --> 19:41.440
But this year, the Shanghai contract

19:41.440 --> 19:42.510
has been delayed.

19:42.590 --> 19:43.850
After looking into it,

19:43.960 --> 19:45.880
we found out that it had been

19:45.880 --> 19:46.920
intercepted by Li Wantang.

19:46.920 --> 19:48.830
He's obtained the exclusive right
to trade tea,

19:48.830 --> 19:50.480
so the foreign merchants
won't do business with us anymore.

19:50.480 --> 19:52.070
We've thought about it again and again,

19:52.070 --> 19:53.110
and there was really no other way.

19:53.110 --> 19:55.550
That's why they sent me
to come talk to you.

19:56.720 --> 19:58.110
What's the point of talking to me?

19:58.110 --> 19:59.590
I've never dealt with foreigners before.

19:59.590 --> 20:01.050
You're different from us.

20:01.400 --> 20:03.160
After all, you hold an official position.

20:03.160 --> 20:04.960
You could at least mediate for us

20:05.070 --> 20:06.810
and help us Anhui tea merchants

20:06.920 --> 20:07.400
to...

20:07.830 --> 20:09.230
To overcome this crisis.

20:09.680 --> 20:11.310
As a Pacification Commissioner,

20:11.310 --> 20:12.750
I do have to deal with

20:12.750 --> 20:13.440
officials,

20:14.070 --> 20:14.880
but I myself

20:14.880 --> 20:15.940
am not an official.

20:17.400 --> 20:18.580
As you know,

20:19.000 --> 20:19.920
I'm an exile

20:19.960 --> 20:21.440
who escaped from Ningguta.

20:21.440 --> 20:23.240
I've been through hell and back.

20:23.240 --> 20:25.310
Now that I've finally made it back
to Huizhou,

20:25.310 --> 20:26.970
just being able to enjoy peace

20:27.000 --> 20:28.800
and take care of my mother at home

20:29.160 --> 20:30.820
makes me completely content.

20:31.000 --> 20:32.430
As for becoming an official,

20:32.430 --> 20:33.430
or being like you,

20:33.780 --> 20:35.510
managing so many tea merchants,

20:35.510 --> 20:37.640
I truly have no such ambition anymore.

20:38.070 --> 20:39.200
Please understand.

20:45.070 --> 20:46.110
I see.

20:51.030 --> 20:51.760
Well then...

20:53.590 --> 20:55.390
Sorry for disturbing your rest.

20:56.750 --> 20:57.680
I'll be on my way.

20:58.790 --> 20:59.590
Old Master Hu.

21:02.110 --> 21:03.160
What is Li Wantang

21:03.720 --> 21:05.200
really up to,

21:05.750 --> 21:07.880
bullying us Huizhou merchants like this?

21:07.880 --> 21:09.240
He says your Top Tea Under Heaven

21:09.240 --> 21:10.510
has stolen his thunder,

21:10.510 --> 21:11.640
and if you don't die,

21:11.640 --> 21:12.700
he won't rest easy.

21:14.720 --> 21:15.980
Did he really say that?

21:19.030 --> 21:20.890
He won't rest easy until I'm dead?

21:20.960 --> 21:21.560
Well then.

21:22.750 --> 21:24.480
I'll make him even more uneasy.

21:24.830 --> 21:27.380
This matter needs to be handled fairly,

21:27.510 --> 21:30.240
so my father can have
more credibility out there.

21:30.590 --> 21:32.590
So how much of a discount
do you want?

21:35.180 --> 21:36.480
Just tell us.

21:36.790 --> 21:37.270
Say it.

21:39.310 --> 21:40.030
80% off.

21:41.160 --> 21:42.200
80% off?

21:42.830 --> 21:43.790
Why don't you just rob us then?

21:43.790 --> 21:45.520
Yeah, might as well be robbery!

21:45.790 --> 21:48.190
How can you do business
with no conscience?

21:49.160 --> 21:50.070
Everyone, please.

21:50.070 --> 21:50.720
Everyone!

21:50.920 --> 21:51.790
Everyone.

21:52.750 --> 21:53.880
Don't rush.

21:54.960 --> 21:56.260
One at a time, please.

21:56.400 --> 21:58.550
My father isn't the only one in this world

21:58.550 --> 22:00.440
who knows how to sell tea.

22:00.680 --> 22:01.880
You've been in the tea business

22:01.880 --> 22:02.940
your entire lives.

22:04.030 --> 22:05.750
Each of you is an expert.

22:06.480 --> 22:07.680
Logically speaking,

22:08.000 --> 22:10.530
even if I rushed to learn,
I wouldn't qualify.

22:10.790 --> 22:12.050
But there's one thing.

22:12.640 --> 22:13.440
The Li family,

22:14.440 --> 22:16.240
blessed by His Majesty's favor,

22:16.360 --> 22:18.090
represents the imperial court

22:18.110 --> 22:20.200
in overseeing

22:20.200 --> 22:21.600
all foreign trade of tea.

22:22.370 --> 22:24.240
Any fluctuation in this business

22:24.920 --> 22:26.580
could bring serious trouble.

22:31.530 --> 22:32.590
Using the imperial court's power

22:32.590 --> 22:34.000
to force people into doing business

22:34.000 --> 22:35.660
is hardly the act of a true man.

22:37.720 --> 22:39.440
Old Master Hu.

22:46.220 --> 22:47.350
I knew it was you.

22:48.360 --> 22:49.680
Last time
you informed Yu'er and Mr. Chang

22:49.680 --> 22:50.740
to come and save me,

22:50.790 --> 22:52.320
and I haven't had the chance
to thank you in person.

22:52.320 --> 22:53.510
No need for that.

22:54.480 --> 22:55.000
So,

22:55.440 --> 22:56.440
you've made up your mind

22:56.440 --> 22:58.040
to get involved in this mess?

22:58.400 --> 22:59.000
Everyone.

22:59.530 --> 23:01.580
For Gu Pingyuan's sake,

23:02.070 --> 23:03.160
I'll take 10% off

23:03.770 --> 23:05.570
the original discount request.

23:05.750 --> 23:07.280
But that's as far as I'll go.

23:08.190 --> 23:09.920
You're quite full of yourself.

23:10.110 --> 23:12.370
I'm afraid I can't agree with you, buddy.

23:12.500 --> 23:13.960
Then we'll see about that.

23:19.000 --> 23:21.220
I'll stay at the inn for 3 more days,

23:21.250 --> 23:23.250
and then I'll return to the capital.

23:23.370 --> 23:24.700
I'll wait for your news.

23:33.020 --> 23:35.220
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

23:35.420 --> 23:36.150
Listen to me.

23:36.420 --> 23:37.030
Come on.

23:49.690 --> 23:52.430
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

23:53.140 --> 23:53.880
Everyone.

23:54.510 --> 23:55.960
I've invited Mr. Gu

23:56.420 --> 23:57.790
to come handle this matter.

23:57.790 --> 23:58.790
Does anyone

23:59.390 --> 24:00.590
have any objections?

24:04.480 --> 24:07.200
If he really takes advantage of
the imperial court's power,

24:07.200 --> 24:09.400
I'm afraid even Mr. Gu
wouldn't be able to win.

24:09.400 --> 24:10.660
So what if we can't win?

24:10.960 --> 24:12.760
Should we just end our own lives?

24:13.790 --> 24:14.680
80% off.

24:14.950 --> 24:19.530
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

24:15.270 --> 24:16.880
All the tea farmers in Anhui

24:16.920 --> 24:18.310
might as well hang themselves

24:18.310 --> 24:20.110
and starve themselves to death.

24:25.070 --> 24:27.030
I think no matter what,

24:28.000 --> 24:28.830
we have to stand up

24:28.830 --> 24:29.630
against them.

24:29.940 --> 24:30.880
This 80% discount

24:30.880 --> 24:32.470
was set by Li Wantang himself.

24:32.470 --> 24:33.510
The imperial court can't possibly manage

24:33.510 --> 24:34.840
such specific details.

24:35.030 --> 24:37.000
Li Wantang has powerful connections.

24:37.000 --> 24:39.070
There are so many tea farmers
north and south of the Yangtze River,

24:39.070 --> 24:40.270
and those big tea merchants

24:40.270 --> 24:41.160
hate us now.

24:41.720 --> 24:42.720
How can we possibly fight against them?

24:42.720 --> 24:43.400
Exactly.

24:46.830 --> 24:47.960
Unlike before,

24:47.730 --> 24:51.870
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

24:48.640 --> 24:49.550
the Guangzhou 13 Trading Houses

24:49.550 --> 24:50.440
are no longer the only channel

24:50.440 --> 24:52.190
for doing business with foreigners.

24:52.190 --> 24:53.590
I want to make a trip there

24:54.430 --> 24:55.900
and pave the way.

24:56.790 --> 24:58.720
Whatever Li Wantang is capable of,

24:58.720 --> 24:59.880
we can do it too.

25:25.870 --> 25:27.130
Is that almost enough?

25:27.750 --> 25:28.830
This is only half a bucket.

25:28.830 --> 25:29.760
Far from enough.

25:30.110 --> 25:31.570
Ms. Bai needs water to wash herself,

25:31.570 --> 25:32.590
your mother needs water to brew medicine,

25:32.590 --> 25:33.920
and we need water to drink.

25:33.920 --> 25:35.240
Why are you so lazy?

25:35.350 --> 25:36.790
You want me to go instead?

25:37.200 --> 25:38.400
It's so hot today.

25:39.200 --> 25:40.260
Let's take a break.

25:42.440 --> 25:43.900
Take a break too, will you?

25:44.510 --> 25:45.910
I don't have your luxury.

25:46.270 --> 25:47.160
That pharmacy down the mountain

25:47.160 --> 25:48.370
sells ready-made medicine.

25:48.370 --> 25:49.830
Why don't we just buy some?

25:49.920 --> 25:51.720
Buying ready-made medicine
costs money, okay?

25:51.720 --> 25:52.440
It's easy for you

25:52.440 --> 25:53.750
to just flap your lips.

25:57.440 --> 25:58.070
Alright then.

25:58.070 --> 25:58.870
I'll go buy it.

25:59.270 --> 26:00.270
Give me the money.

26:18.790 --> 26:19.920
That's all I've got.

26:21.470 --> 26:23.160
I still have some at my shop
down the mountain.

26:23.160 --> 26:24.760
I'll go get some more for you.

26:26.840 --> 26:27.640
Get back here.

26:28.590 --> 26:29.160
Come on.

26:31.880 --> 26:32.480
Take this.

26:33.200 --> 26:34.310
Why give me money?

26:34.670 --> 26:35.720
Didn't you ask for it?

26:35.720 --> 26:36.790
You'd just give it to me because I asked?

26:36.790 --> 26:37.650
What am I to you?

26:47.720 --> 26:49.450
Just leave it there. I'll do it.

26:50.880 --> 26:52.210
Well, I... I can do more.

26:52.480 --> 26:53.200
Come here.

26:57.480 --> 26:58.770
If you can do more,

26:59.030 --> 27:00.290
help me with this then.

27:02.570 --> 27:05.550
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

27:05.790 --> 27:06.790
How strange.

27:07.350 --> 27:08.810
I'm usually quite clever,

27:08.920 --> 27:09.640
but whenever I see you,

27:09.640 --> 27:11.970
I can't seem to find
the right thing to say.

27:14.550 --> 27:15.070
Come on.

27:15.070 --> 27:16.350
Let me help you.

27:16.350 --> 27:17.140
No need. No need.

27:17.140 --> 27:18.720
This is my livelihood after all.

27:18.720 --> 27:19.750
Yes, of course.

27:20.140 --> 27:26.650
[Blessings and Auspiciousness]

27:20.920 --> 27:21.920
Take care.

27:22.920 --> 27:24.790
Thank you. Thank you.

27:31.510 --> 27:31.960
Boy.

27:33.700 --> 27:35.300
What were you doing just now?

27:37.030 --> 27:38.830
Well, I just came back from work.

27:38.870 --> 27:40.440
I said the kudzu powder

27:40.440 --> 27:41.980
could be bought from down the mountain,

27:41.980 --> 27:43.240
and Ms. Su got upset.

27:43.310 --> 27:44.570
Of course she's upset.

27:45.160 --> 27:47.270
She's helping you
take care of a patient,

27:47.270 --> 27:49.160
yet you're making her use her own money

27:49.160 --> 27:50.610
to go down the mountain
and buy medicine for you.

27:50.610 --> 27:52.140
Aren't you going too far?

27:53.070 --> 27:54.920
No, I-I was paying for it.

27:54.960 --> 27:55.480
I already took out

27:55.480 --> 27:56.480
the money just now.

27:56.480 --> 27:57.590
I don't believe you.

27:57.590 --> 27:58.850
How did you take it out?

27:59.270 --> 27:59.670
How...

27:59.680 --> 28:00.160
I-I-I...

28:00.160 --> 28:00.690
I just...

28:01.590 --> 28:02.750
I just gave it to her like this.

28:02.750 --> 28:03.920
There you go.

28:05.030 --> 28:06.330
That's easy to fix.

28:06.440 --> 28:07.830
I'll give this to my daughter

28:07.830 --> 28:10.690
and let her go down the mountain
to get the medicine immediately.

28:10.690 --> 28:11.480
Don't worry.

28:12.310 --> 28:14.180
This is life-saving money.

28:14.240 --> 28:15.880
I won't spend it elsewhere.

28:21.680 --> 28:23.240
Mother, you called me?

28:26.310 --> 28:28.750
If anyone comes to
visit your brother again,

28:28.750 --> 28:30.210
turn them away at the door.

28:30.920 --> 28:32.720
That won't be necessary, Mother.

28:32.720 --> 28:33.680
Without Pingyuan,

28:33.680 --> 28:34.980
are we not doing business anymore?

28:34.980 --> 28:35.680
If they have matters to discuss,

28:35.680 --> 28:36.740
they can talk to me.

28:38.640 --> 28:39.440
I have matters!

28:39.440 --> 28:41.370
I have matters to discuss with you!

28:42.110 --> 28:42.510
You...

28:42.510 --> 28:43.960
You always say your eyesight is poor,

28:43.960 --> 28:45.690
but your aim is quite accurate.

28:47.270 --> 28:48.310
Don't forget

28:48.690 --> 28:50.820
Ms. Bai is still recovering next door.

28:51.440 --> 28:52.510
Whose wife is she?

28:52.910 --> 28:53.920
And whose child

28:53.920 --> 28:54.920
is she carrying?

28:56.260 --> 28:57.480
Pingyuan went through so much trouble

28:57.480 --> 28:59.370
to save her life and bring her back.

28:59.370 --> 29:00.410
If anyone

29:00.650 --> 29:02.750
has bad intentions
and says something wrong,

29:02.750 --> 29:03.750
using two lives

29:03.790 --> 29:05.790
to gain promotion and wealth
for themselves,

29:05.790 --> 29:06.790
then all Pingyuan's efforts

29:06.790 --> 29:07.920
would be in vain.

29:07.960 --> 29:10.270
How should our family survive then?

29:12.270 --> 29:14.000
You could have told me earlier.

29:14.160 --> 29:15.960
It's not like I'm unreasonable.

29:17.350 --> 29:18.790
In my opinion, on this matter,

29:18.790 --> 29:19.750
Pingyuan made a mistake.

29:19.750 --> 29:22.000
Even I, Gu Pingwen, am smarter than he is.

29:22.000 --> 29:22.440
Right.

29:22.720 --> 29:23.330
You're smart.

29:23.330 --> 29:24.240
You're clever.

29:28.310 --> 29:29.440
I think we've done

29:29.440 --> 29:31.200
more than enough for the Bai family.

29:31.200 --> 29:32.470
That Bai Yimei.

29:33.110 --> 29:33.550
She...

29:34.440 --> 29:36.000
She owes us too much.

29:36.680 --> 29:38.240
That engagement since childhood,

29:38.240 --> 29:38.680
right?

29:38.830 --> 29:40.640
She ran off with that commanding general

29:40.640 --> 29:42.700
and even got pregnant with his child.

29:43.000 --> 29:44.680
Pingyuan spent so much effort and money

29:44.680 --> 29:45.350
and almost lost his life

29:45.350 --> 29:46.880
just to save her from death.

29:47.720 --> 29:49.440
It's not worth it
no matter how you look at it.

29:49.440 --> 29:50.750
Yes, right.

29:50.830 --> 29:51.790
So you're smart!

29:52.160 --> 29:53.160
You're smarter than Pingyuan,

29:53.160 --> 29:53.820
aren't you?

29:54.750 --> 29:55.950
Look how smart you...

29:56.510 --> 29:58.110
Stand up and look at yourself.

29:58.110 --> 30:00.020
Look at all this dirt from kneeling.

30:00.020 --> 30:01.660
All this dust. Look at you.

30:08.030 --> 30:09.550
Don't pull me in broad daylight.

30:09.550 --> 30:10.350
How inappropriate.

30:10.350 --> 30:11.550
Easy now. Easy, easy.

30:12.000 --> 30:12.960
Where's my father?

30:12.960 --> 30:13.830
Where is he?

30:14.070 --> 30:15.070
Haven't seen him.

30:15.110 --> 30:16.000
He went to buy medicine.

30:16.000 --> 30:16.800
Buy medicine?

30:17.070 --> 30:19.400
He had no money.
How could he buy medicine?

30:20.030 --> 30:21.030
H-He came by earlier,

30:21.030 --> 30:22.360
asking what I was doing.

30:22.590 --> 30:23.590
I said I was back from work,

30:23.590 --> 30:24.440
and that I told you

30:24.440 --> 30:25.510
I was going down the mountain
to buy medicine.

30:25.510 --> 30:26.920
He said... He said he would go instead,

30:26.920 --> 30:28.180
so I gave him the money.

30:28.750 --> 30:30.310
How many times have I told you

30:30.310 --> 30:31.550
not to give him money?

30:31.590 --> 30:33.000
He won't come back until he's gambled away

30:33.000 --> 30:34.400
everything down to his pants.

30:34.400 --> 30:35.590
I've told you so many times.

30:35.590 --> 30:36.940
Why can't you remember?

30:37.400 --> 30:37.960
No, it's not like that.

30:37.960 --> 30:39.270
Isn't he your father?

30:39.310 --> 30:40.270
Just consider it my way of
showing respect to him,

30:40.270 --> 30:40.960
okay?

30:41.130 --> 30:41.830
Otherwise, if he

30:41.830 --> 30:42.400
gets angry

30:42.400 --> 30:43.510
and doesn't approve of our marriage,

30:43.510 --> 30:44.750
what am I supposed to do then?

30:44.750 --> 30:45.310
You

30:45.480 --> 30:46.590
are in for trouble.

30:50.790 --> 30:51.640
I brought you two cans

30:51.640 --> 30:52.590
of such fine tea,

30:52.880 --> 30:54.680
yet here you are, drinking wine.

30:55.400 --> 30:57.790
Tea only makes you more sober.

30:58.460 --> 30:59.960
Why don't you join me for a drink instead?

30:59.960 --> 31:00.440
Here.

31:01.440 --> 31:03.500
Try this wine the foreigners gave me.

31:13.830 --> 31:15.410
Such a good thing you have here.

31:15.410 --> 31:16.000
Try it.

31:20.590 --> 31:21.830
If you like it,

31:21.960 --> 31:22.920
I have plenty.

31:22.980 --> 31:25.910
I'll have someone deliver a few barrels
to your home.

31:27.270 --> 31:28.160
Well, how about

31:28.200 --> 31:31.000
introducing me to
some foreign merchants as well?

31:32.490 --> 31:33.640
If I did that,

31:34.400 --> 31:35.510
my father would beat me

31:35.510 --> 31:36.200
to death.

31:36.790 --> 31:38.790
I'd be biting the hand that feeds me.

31:41.440 --> 31:42.680
Your father is always so harsh

31:42.680 --> 31:43.880
when dealing with me.

31:44.070 --> 31:45.530
After all, I'm his junior.

31:48.960 --> 31:50.270
If you ask me,

31:52.070 --> 31:54.070
my father has been quite nice to you,

31:54.790 --> 31:56.110
not harsh at all.

31:57.070 --> 31:57.830
At that Grand Tea Competition,

31:57.830 --> 31:59.790
my father spent money like water

32:00.000 --> 32:01.590
and finally built a stage,

32:02.900 --> 32:03.830
only for the whole thing

32:03.830 --> 32:05.430
to become your one-man show.

32:06.260 --> 32:08.160
He doesn't just hate you—

32:08.600 --> 32:10.480
he even wants to eat you alive.

32:13.350 --> 32:14.480
I think this time, buddy,

32:14.480 --> 32:16.130
you've stirred up a hornet's nest.

32:16.130 --> 32:17.290
So many tea merchants

32:17.290 --> 32:18.400
and so much money

32:19.350 --> 32:22.080
all ended up benefiting
the Anhui tea merchants.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.960
What even is that "Top Tea Under Heaven"?

32:23.960 --> 32:25.310
I've never heard of it.

32:25.310 --> 32:26.770
You must be joking with me.

32:28.070 --> 32:28.680
My father

32:29.960 --> 32:31.760
arrived with his head held high,

32:31.960 --> 32:33.690
yet left completely dejected.

32:33.990 --> 32:35.250
If people start saying

32:36.030 --> 32:37.310
that even Li Million has times

32:37.310 --> 32:38.680
when he can't be counted on,

32:38.680 --> 32:39.550
wouldn't that ruin his reputation?

32:39.550 --> 32:41.550
Who else should he get back at
if not you?

32:41.550 --> 32:43.210
He won't be able to explain it.

32:53.770 --> 32:55.270
What's the deal with

32:55.270 --> 32:57.040
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association?

32:57.040 --> 32:59.840
Are they determined to turn against
the Li family?

33:00.510 --> 33:02.010
Your father is too ruthless,

33:02.010 --> 33:02.960
trying to buy their spring tea

33:02.960 --> 33:04.550
at 20% of the original price.

33:04.550 --> 33:06.480
It doesn't even cover labor costs.

33:13.240 --> 33:14.300
About this matter,

33:15.470 --> 33:16.750
I have no say in it.

33:18.070 --> 33:19.930
I'm just delivering the message.

33:20.810 --> 33:22.210
Do you know why he sent me?

33:22.830 --> 33:23.550
Four words:

33:24.160 --> 33:25.350
to take the blame.

33:27.010 --> 33:28.550
That's refreshingly honest.

33:28.550 --> 33:29.130
Indeed it is.

33:29.130 --> 33:30.240
I actually came here

33:30.240 --> 33:31.550
planning to have

33:31.550 --> 33:33.070
a proper competition with you.

33:33.070 --> 33:34.000
But in this situation,

33:34.000 --> 33:35.240
it would be too unfair.

33:35.240 --> 33:36.160
Maybe next time,

33:36.160 --> 33:36.960
when I have my own

33:36.960 --> 33:37.680
business.

33:38.370 --> 33:39.270
So when will you

33:39.310 --> 33:40.640
have your own business?

33:40.920 --> 33:41.780
My father said,

33:42.270 --> 33:44.200
once the south is reclaimed,

33:44.640 --> 33:45.880
he'll let me manage

33:45.920 --> 33:46.650
our family's

33:46.750 --> 33:47.610
salt business.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.160
That's over 300 salt shops

33:49.480 --> 33:51.830
in 7 southern provinces
and 6 northern provinces.

33:51.830 --> 33:53.880
Actually, I don't need all 300 shops.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.480
Just one.

33:55.000 --> 33:56.400
Just one would be enough.

33:56.720 --> 33:58.780
As long as I can make my own decisions,

33:59.030 --> 34:00.000
instead of following him around

34:00.000 --> 34:00.790
all day long,

34:00.790 --> 34:02.550
doing these thankless jobs.

34:08.710 --> 34:09.840
Where are you going?

34:09.880 --> 34:11.190
To find some foreign merchants.

34:11.190 --> 34:12.110
I can't really be driven to death

34:12.110 --> 34:13.310
by your father, can I?

34:13.630 --> 34:16.630
But you don't know anyone.
How do you want to find them?

34:18.020 --> 34:19.760
Do you know Hart,

34:19.760 --> 34:20.920
the Customs Commissioner?

34:20.920 --> 34:22.920
Do you know Richard

34:22.920 --> 34:24.280
from Xianghe Trade House?

34:24.280 --> 34:25.409
Have you ever been to

34:25.630 --> 34:26.690
the Shanghai Bund?

34:31.440 --> 34:32.320
If you ask me,

34:32.920 --> 34:34.000
this is what you should do:

34:34.000 --> 34:35.590
go buy a rope

34:35.949 --> 34:36.920
and hang yourself

34:36.920 --> 34:38.030
from the beam at our doorway.

34:38.030 --> 34:39.150
I'll take your body

34:39.150 --> 34:40.400
to my father so he can vent his anger.

34:40.400 --> 34:42.460
I promise to give you a proper burial.

34:43.030 --> 34:44.550
Once you have your own business,

34:44.550 --> 34:46.550
I'll definitely teach you a lesson.

34:46.550 --> 34:48.150
Take care! See yourself out.

34:51.489 --> 34:53.280
I just borrowed money from him yesterday.

34:53.280 --> 34:54.630
Think of something.

34:54.630 --> 34:55.710
I'll have to make up an excuse.

34:55.710 --> 34:56.400
Otherwise,

34:56.550 --> 34:57.840
he'll think I'm being unreliable again.

34:57.840 --> 34:59.150
Now you know to think things over?

34:59.150 --> 34:59.760
Pingwen.

35:00.400 --> 35:01.880
Pack your things and come with me
to Shanghai.

35:01.880 --> 35:02.670
We're leaving this afternoon.

35:02.670 --> 35:03.420
I'll go tell Mother.

35:03.420 --> 35:05.760
Pingyuan, I still have something
to attend to.

35:05.760 --> 35:06.400
What is it?

35:08.290 --> 35:10.670
Her father is being held at
the gambling house down the mountain.

35:10.670 --> 35:11.530
What happened?

35:11.590 --> 35:12.580
I told Pingwen

35:12.670 --> 35:14.320
not to give my father any money.

35:14.320 --> 35:15.510
Pingwen is such a fool.

35:15.510 --> 35:16.230
Yesterday, he gave

35:16.230 --> 35:17.440
my father some pennies.

35:17.440 --> 35:18.250
Guess what happened?

35:18.250 --> 35:19.960
He didn't come back last night.

35:19.960 --> 35:21.300
The gambling house just sent word

35:21.300 --> 35:22.560
that he lost 500 taels,

35:22.710 --> 35:23.960
and we must pay his ransom
by this afternoon.

35:23.960 --> 35:24.670
Two hours late

35:24.670 --> 35:25.920
means one finger off.

35:26.440 --> 35:28.360
We were just discussing what to do.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.480
What's there to discuss?

35:29.480 --> 35:30.230
I'll give you the money,

35:30.230 --> 35:32.030
and you go bail him out right away.

35:32.030 --> 35:32.800
I need to go on a trip with Pingwen

35:32.800 --> 35:33.930
in the next few days.

35:34.360 --> 35:35.400
Please take care of Ms. Bai

35:35.400 --> 35:36.230
and my mother.

35:36.360 --> 35:36.760
Okay.

35:37.070 --> 35:38.760
Pingyuan, you're so generous.

35:38.760 --> 35:40.670
Actually, we were just talking about

35:40.670 --> 35:41.960
how to find an excuse

35:42.000 --> 35:43.400
to borrow money from you.

35:43.510 --> 35:45.370
You just say everything out loud!

35:48.070 --> 35:49.270
She hits me every day.

35:49.800 --> 35:51.200
I've really spoiled her.

35:57.920 --> 35:59.440
Tell her that this money

35:59.840 --> 36:01.590
is a gift to show our respect
to her father,

36:01.590 --> 36:02.630
not something she borrowed from us.

36:02.630 --> 36:04.490
Don't say anything unnecessary.

36:04.730 --> 36:05.730
Pack your things.

36:07.440 --> 36:09.640
[Gu's Mansion]

36:20.780 --> 36:21.440
Gu.

36:24.230 --> 36:25.420
What did the doctor say?

36:25.420 --> 36:26.620
When will she wake up?

36:27.880 --> 36:30.590
The doctor said she refuses to wake up.

36:33.390 --> 36:34.450
Refuses to wake up?

36:36.800 --> 36:38.800
It's a blessing to refuse to wake up.

36:39.690 --> 36:41.220
I don't have such blessing.

36:47.630 --> 36:49.880
From now on, you'll be taking care of her.

36:49.880 --> 36:50.810
Talk to her more.

36:53.550 --> 36:54.000
I...

36:55.030 --> 36:56.110
What should I say?

36:57.500 --> 36:58.330
Tell her

36:59.110 --> 37:01.440
she's still pregnant with
Li Cheng's kid,

37:01.670 --> 37:02.590
and she still needs to

37:02.590 --> 37:03.440
raise the kid.

37:04.550 --> 37:05.810
She has no right to die.

37:07.840 --> 37:08.280
I...

37:08.960 --> 37:10.490
I'll tell her exactly that?

37:11.900 --> 37:13.760
Or what else would you like to say?

37:14.360 --> 37:16.940
I've been through life and death
so many times,

37:16.940 --> 37:18.800
yet I still managed to crawl back.

37:38.230 --> 37:38.920
How much do you think

37:38.920 --> 37:40.520
it will cost to buy this ship?

37:41.120 --> 37:42.550
How would I know?

37:43.940 --> 37:45.380
This is the reason

37:45.630 --> 37:46.630
why the foreigners could run amok

37:46.630 --> 37:47.760
on our river.

37:47.960 --> 37:49.420
Meanwhile, our merchants

37:49.430 --> 37:50.880
are still fighting among themselves,

37:50.880 --> 37:52.480
having the time of their lives.

37:52.480 --> 37:53.280
How pathetic.

37:57.590 --> 37:58.190
Pingyuan.

37:58.320 --> 38:00.180
Can I discuss something with you?

38:00.320 --> 38:02.070
If you don't want to be
the Pacification Commissioner anymore,

38:02.070 --> 38:03.630
let me have the position
for a couple of days.

38:03.630 --> 38:04.880
You can't even manage a shop properly,

38:04.880 --> 38:06.000
and you want to be
the Pacification Commissioner?

38:06.000 --> 38:06.550
Look, since I

38:06.550 --> 38:07.630
took this position,

38:07.630 --> 38:09.400
have I had a single peaceful day?

38:09.400 --> 38:10.400
Once we go ashore,

38:10.590 --> 38:11.320
we'll first visit

38:11.320 --> 38:13.180
Hart, the Customs Commissioner.

38:15.230 --> 38:18.140
[Shanghai, Hart's Residence]

38:42.440 --> 38:43.500
What are you doing?

38:46.030 --> 38:48.030
His accent is even better than mine.

38:49.480 --> 38:50.670
Our Mr. Hart

38:50.730 --> 38:52.110
is favored by the imperial court

38:52.110 --> 38:54.110
and oversees the Qing Empire's customs.

38:54.110 --> 38:55.110
His son

38:55.320 --> 38:56.700
even earned a degree
in the imperial examination.

38:56.700 --> 38:58.480
His eight-part essay was so well written

38:58.480 --> 39:00.480
that the chief examiner was amazed.

39:02.360 --> 39:04.500
That little bastard you were talking about

39:04.500 --> 39:05.860
actually became a scholar candidate.

39:05.860 --> 39:07.920
Let's see how he does in the next exam.

39:09.280 --> 39:09.960
Mr. Gu,

39:10.550 --> 39:12.920
if you have something to say, go ahead.

39:13.830 --> 39:14.590
Mr. Hart,

39:15.100 --> 39:16.880
I'd like to ask you
to arrange a meeting with

39:16.880 --> 39:18.110
Mr. Richard from Xianghe Trade House.

39:18.110 --> 39:19.440
I want to get to know him.

39:20.230 --> 39:21.690
Why do you want to meet him?

39:22.480 --> 39:24.030
With the recent victory in Hefei

39:24.030 --> 39:25.920
and the abundant tea harvest
in Anhui this year,

39:25.920 --> 39:28.110
our province is waiting for this money.

39:28.110 --> 39:30.110
Tea farmers need to support
their families,

39:30.110 --> 39:31.750
the government needs to
comfort the refugees,

39:31.750 --> 39:33.400
and the imperial court also hopes
that local regions

39:33.400 --> 39:35.030
can recover their strength
as soon as possible.

39:35.030 --> 39:36.750
But Mr. Richard

39:36.780 --> 39:38.190
isn't buying a single tael of tea
from Anhui

39:38.190 --> 39:38.960
this year.

39:39.440 --> 39:41.700
I don't understand what he means by that.

39:42.760 --> 39:44.510
Business is inherently

39:45.150 --> 39:47.880
voluntary between both parties.

39:48.920 --> 39:50.280
Richard is a merchant.

39:50.630 --> 39:52.590
He works for the East India Company.

39:52.590 --> 39:53.960
If he doesn't want to buy,

39:53.960 --> 39:55.030
you can't force him

39:55.030 --> 39:56.670
with your official position, right?

39:56.670 --> 39:58.800
But I can't just go back empty-handed.

39:58.860 --> 39:59.660
How abut this?

40:00.000 --> 40:01.800
Please arrange a meeting with him anyway.

40:01.800 --> 40:03.000
If I can't make a deal,

40:03.110 --> 40:05.110
you can count it as my incompetence.

40:05.320 --> 40:07.240
You're in luck today.

40:07.320 --> 40:09.340
He's having tea in my backyard.

40:10.280 --> 40:11.110
However,

40:11.320 --> 40:12.550
I must warn you.

40:12.710 --> 40:15.310
This man is someone
you can't afford to offend.

40:18.670 --> 40:19.550
So technically,

40:19.550 --> 40:20.440
the whole ship

40:20.440 --> 40:21.440
was looking at me,

40:21.440 --> 40:23.000
and it was so funny.

40:23.280 --> 40:24.320
And I was like,

40:24.800 --> 40:25.280
what,

40:25.550 --> 40:26.280
why?

40:28.110 --> 40:29.360
Look at these guys.

40:29.480 --> 40:32.740
-Probably asking for money.
-Ladies, if you'll excuse us.

40:35.510 --> 40:37.110
This is Mr. Richard.

40:37.550 --> 40:38.880
This is Mr. Gu,

40:38.920 --> 40:41.670
representing the Anhui Tea Merchants.

40:41.760 --> 40:43.280
He came from his hometown.

40:50.480 --> 40:51.440
Mr. Richard.

40:51.710 --> 40:52.590
I'd like to know

40:52.590 --> 40:54.030
why you're not purchasing

40:54.030 --> 40:55.630
any tea from Anhui this year.

40:55.820 --> 40:58.870
[Richard, Director of Xianghe Trade House]

40:57.840 --> 40:58.900
Is there a problem?

40:59.070 --> 40:59.630
I'm here representing

40:59.630 --> 41:01.150
the Anhui Tea Merchants' Association.

41:01.150 --> 41:03.350
I'd like to know the reason behind this.

41:03.710 --> 41:06.070
I've signed an exclusive contract

41:06.150 --> 41:07.630
with Mr. Li Wantang from the capital.

41:07.630 --> 41:09.360
I only buy tea from him.

41:10.360 --> 41:11.840
Whether that tea is from Anhui or not

41:11.840 --> 41:12.970
doesn't concern me.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.550
Your dispute

41:16.590 --> 41:18.070
doesn't concern me, either.

41:18.070 --> 41:19.670
Please don't waste my time.

41:27.320 --> 41:28.480
We don't need to be

41:28.480 --> 41:30.080
so confrontational from the start.

41:30.080 --> 41:31.590
Anhui has always been

41:31.630 --> 41:33.860
a major tea-producing province
in our country.

41:33.860 --> 41:35.910
Li Wantang can choose to give it up,

41:36.000 --> 41:37.670
but can you really bear to give it up?

41:37.670 --> 41:39.130
It's a huge business deal.

41:40.880 --> 41:42.210
Though the deal is good,

41:42.710 --> 41:43.670
I cannot afford to offend

41:43.670 --> 41:44.590
my partner.

41:45.480 --> 41:47.340
The Qing Empire has 18 provinces.

41:47.550 --> 41:48.550
Losing one

41:49.590 --> 41:50.520
doesn't matter.

41:51.070 --> 41:52.400
That's the conclusion.

41:52.510 --> 41:53.240
Conclusion?

41:54.630 --> 41:55.230
Also,

41:56.480 --> 41:59.590
don't try to negotiate with
other foreign merchants.

42:00.070 --> 42:02.760
The Great Qing Legal Code
forbids Chinese people

42:02.760 --> 42:05.630
from doing business
with foreigners privately.

42:09.480 --> 42:11.510
I advise you not to speak so absolutely.

42:11.510 --> 42:13.170
I can give you another chance.

42:18.110 --> 42:18.760
Chance?

42:20.510 --> 42:21.710
What chance?

42:22.440 --> 42:24.760
To put me on a ship back to England?

42:29.440 --> 42:30.510
My god.

42:33.070 --> 42:34.470
Want to make a bet with me?

42:35.750 --> 42:37.470
I bet you'll regret it.

42:41.630 --> 42:42.230
Pingyuan,

42:42.280 --> 42:43.630
don't be mad.

42:54.920 --> 42:55.920
Captain Tod wants to know

42:55.920 --> 42:57.120
what brings you here.

43:00.400 --> 43:01.190
Ask him

43:01.710 --> 43:02.630
if this ship is for sale.
